# ── Runtime skills are a BUILD ARTIFACT ──────────────────────────────────────
# packages/skills/ is the versioned source of truth. scripts/build-skills.ts
# copies it here at build time, and the runtime process runs with cwd set to
# packages/runtime/ so the Agent SDK finds them. Never edit, never commit.
packages/runtime/.claude/
